  "changed_factors": [
    "Set bispf_thermal_application=displacement: during G/E/prior forward/backward, temporarily unscale the existing BISPF critic forward hook and SBNP thermal branch; after the existing normalized/direction-blended optimizer step, multiply the actual combined G/E/prior displacement by the original earned thermal scale exactly once. This changes the prior gradient cooling policy and applied prior update, while retaining learned prior locations, fixed task prior width/weights/capacity, SBNP objective weight .01, and all other recipe fields. Critic gradient cooling and residual observer/reheating are unchanged. No task identifiers, target statistics, new thresholds, clocks, random draws, optimizer momentum, learning rates, evaluation gates or serving changes."
